  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When I set my settings to only show avatars within X Range, or even up to X avatars, I think it would be nice to have a setting to add some kind of delay to when they actually begin loading, say between 1 and 10 seconds. This can be nice for when you're in a group, and people are \"hovering\" near the range of your safety settings which can cause hitching as they continously spawn and despawn. Another thing that this helps is when you're moving quickly through a world of people, you're not instantly stuck downloading every avatar you run close enough to which for some of my friends, causes crashes as their computer struggles to load the 20 avatars they just ran through that are now attempting to hide again as they pass by. This could help massively for both of these situations and I'm sure others if it were possible.",
